# Pairs with SetCaptureCompletes, under the fairness Spec asserts. A
# registration refused by the fence is retried instead of failing its
# sub-saga, so a saga already registered on another member never decides,
# its row never drains, and neither does the capture.
MODULE: SetCaptureCompletesRefusalRetried
TARGET: SetCaptureCompletes
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a fence-refused registration waits and retries instead of aborting its saga
PERTURBS: RegisterRefused

--- FIND
    /\ Fenced(T)
    /\ dec' = [dec EXCEPT ![t] = "aborted"]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<reg, deleg, epoch, prep, loc, term, expired>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ Fenced(T)
    \* MUTATION: the refusal is retried; nothing aborts.
    /\ UNCHANGED <<reg, deleg, epoch, prep, loc, term, dec, expired>>
--- END
